# CONTROL for comment-after-pair.toml. Drop the comment and the extent is
# right.
#
#   pair [0, 7)
#     bare_key [0, 1)
#     string [4, 7)
#
# Both trees, identical, and `standing.py` reports the file sound. So `pair`
# does not systematically stop short - it stops short of a trailing extra it
# has already adopted as a child, which is a much narrower claim and the one a
# fix has to satisfy.
roots 1
mends 0
holds pair
spans pair 0 7
